{'symbol': 'J', 'date': '2023-01-26 07:45:00', 'title': 'JACOBS ANNOUNCES CFO TRANSITION', 'text': 'CLAUDIA JARAMILLO APPOINTED CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, EFFECTIVE AUGUST 14, 2023 KEVIN BERRYMAN TO SERVE AS SPECIAL ADVISOR TO CEO BOB PRAGADA\xa0 DALLAS , JAN. 26, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JACOBS (NYSE: J) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT CLAUDIA JARAMILLO, CURRENTLY JACOBS EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT, STRATEGY AND CORPORATE DEVELOPMENT, WILL SUCCEED KEVIN BERRYMAN AS EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, EFFECTIVE AUGUST 14, 2023. AT THAT TIME, BERRYMAN WILL SERVE AS SPECIAL ADVISOR TO JACOBS CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, BOB PRAGADA.'}